    1 "tellarknight" or "Constellar" Xyz Monster with a different Rank, by using
    that Xyz Monster you control as material. (This is treated as an Xyz Summon.
    Transfer its materials to the Summoned monster.) You can only use this effect
    of "Constellar Tellarknights" once per turn. You can only activate 1 "Constellar
    Tellarknights" per turn.'
